Package: AmmoniTools
Title: Geometric morphometric Tools for Ammonite Shells
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Aimie", "Doriath Döhler", email = "aimie.doriathdohler@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-6984-9989")),
    person("Ewen", "Allain", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: 
    AmmoniTools provides a comprehensive set of tools for geometric 
    morphometric analysis of ammonite shells. It includes functions 
    for 3D landmark processing, missing data reconstruction and Procruste alignment.
    The package is designed to integrate with existing morphometrics
    workflows such as those implemented in 'geomorph' and 'Morpho', 
    and provides both quantitative and visual approaches for analyzing 
    ammonite shell morphology and ontogeny.
